				expose Req::'The RC-Car must either drive autonomously or through manual operation.'::'The RC-Car must drive autonomously.'::'The RC-Car must perceive its environment.'::'The RC-Car must detect nearby objects.';
				expose Req::'The RC-Car must either drive autonomously or through manual operation.'::'The RC-Car must drive autonomously.'::'The RC-Car must perceive its environment.'::'The RC-Car must know its current position.';
