				expose Req::'The RC-Car must either drive autonomously or through manual operation.'::'The RC-Car must be remotely controlled by a Human Machine Interface (HMI).'::'The HMI must enable switching between manual and autonomous control.';
				expose Req::'The RC-Car must either drive autonomously or through manual operation.'::'The RC-Car must be remotely controlled by a Human Machine Interface (HMI).'::'The HMI must enable manual control using a remote controller.';
				expose Req::'The RC-Car must either drive autonomously or through manual operation.'::'The RC-Car must be remotely controlled by a Human Machine Interface (HMI).'::'The HMI must enable manual control through a website.';
